## 14. THE BOTTOM LINE

x204 is the first protocol where identity, trust, payment, and reputation are a single
atomic operation with zero-friction onboarding and a self-improving feedback loop.

Every other system handles these as separate concerns with separate infrastructure:
- x402 = payment only (no identity, no trust, no receipts)
- Maiat = trust only (no payment, no portable identity, centralized)
- ClawStars = social trading only (no services, no portable trust, on-chain only)

x204 merges them all. One HTTP call. One protocol. One receipt.

The agent economy needs this. Build it.
